# Scratch worktrees the Agent tool creates for parallel work. Each one is a
# full checkout of this repo, so committing them would nest the repository
# inside itself five times over; they are also deleted when the agents that
# own them finish. Ignored rather than committed, which is what a stop hook
# asking to commit untracked files should get here.
.claude/worktrees/
